    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a remote island lost in the ocean, an ancient castle rises \u2014 the last sanctuary of magic, sealed within runic stones that sustain the very essence of the world. But darkness is relentlessly advancing. Armies of resurrected undead, led by a malevolent overlord determined to extinguish the final remnants of light, crash wave after wave against the walls of this sacred place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/4fe92f0db0a7816f5f1d13bb3970e254.poster.avif?t=1747330010\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/4fe92f0db0a7816f5f1d13bb3970e254.webm?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/4fe92f0db0a7816f5f1d13bb3970e254.mp4?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You will experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic gameplay and epic battles against the undead army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading physical and magical abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancing armor and weapons to crush enemies more effectively.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting items and elixirs to aid in combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizing character armor and weapons using souls collected in battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/7469d3c410a7b59c848c1c66d2ea0ba0.poster.avif?t=1747330010\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/7469d3c410a7b59c848c1c66d2ea0ba0.webm?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/7469d3c410a7b59c848c1c66d2ea0ba0.mp4?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you preserve the spark of light by defending the runic stones from total destruction? Or will this world sink forever into the abyss of oblivion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/a81d9ceb854fea2187bc4d75157fa2dd.poster.avif?t=1747330010\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/a81d9ceb854fea2187bc4d75157fa2dd.webm?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/a81d9ceb854fea2187bc4d75157fa2dd.mp4?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a remote island lost in the ocean, an ancient castle rises \u2014 the last sanctuary of magic, sealed within runic stones that sustain the very essence of the world. But darkness is relentlessly advancing. Armies of resurrected undead, led by a malevolent overlord determined to extinguish the final remnants of light, crash wave after wave against the walls of this sacred place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/4fe92f0db0a7816f5f1d13bb3970e254.poster.avif?t=1747330010\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/4fe92f0db0a7816f5f1d13bb3970e254.webm?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/4fe92f0db0a7816f5f1d13bb3970e254.mp4?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You will experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic gameplay and epic battles against the undead army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading physical and magical abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancing armor and weapons to crush enemies more effectively.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting items and elixirs to aid in combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizing character armor and weapons using souls collected in battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/7469d3c410a7b59c848c1c66d2ea0ba0.poster.avif?t=1747330010\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/7469d3c410a7b59c848c1c66d2ea0ba0.webm?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/7469d3c410a7b59c848c1c66d2ea0ba0.mp4?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you preserve the spark of light by defending the runic stones from total destruction? Or will this world sink forever into the abyss of oblivion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/a81d9ceb854fea2187bc4d75157fa2dd.poster.avif?t=1747330010\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/a81d9ceb854fea2187bc4d75157fa2dd.webm?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474360/extras/a81d9ceb854fea2187bc4d75157fa2dd.mp4?t=1747330010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
